{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23288","headline":"新秋病起 · 白居易","name":"新秋病起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一叶落梧桐，年光半又空。\n秋多上阶日，凉足入怀风。\n病瘦形如鹤，愁焦鬓似蓬。\n损心诗思里，伐性酒狂中。\n华盖何曾惜，金丹不致功。\n犹须自慙媿，得作白头翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}